  "details": "# Issue:\n\nEvery Setting there is in VRChat (well most of them) has now also been added to the Main Menu so that when you aren't sure where to look for something you can find them in the Main Menu.\n\nThis is however not the case with Quick Menu IK Settings, you can only find them in there.\n\n# Expected Behavior:  \n\nEvery setting should also be available in the Main Menu, so the Quick Menu IK Settings should also be put in the Main Menu IK Settings.\n\nThis way people can easily just find and search fro them, in case they don't know where they are normally.",
